#######
# Setup
#######

Context('Numeric');
$x = random(100, 300, 1);
$distance = 431 - $x;
$L = NumberWithUnits("$distance mi");

#############################
# Exercise Group Introduction
#############################

BEGIN_PGML
If you travel the road from Portland, OR to Boise, ID, and you have traveled [`x`] miles so far, you have [`431 - x`] miles left to go.

END_PGML

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
After traveling [`[$x]`] miles, how far do you have left to go?

[_]{$L}{10}

END_PGML

